                "text": "**Local File Inclusion**\n\nVulnerabilities that allow inclusion of local files through web application flaws\n\n**Impact (type metadata)**\nSource code disclosure, configuration exposure, credential theft, or potential remote code execution\n\n**Mitigation (type metadata)**\nUse allowlists for file paths, avoid user input in file operations, implement proper path validation"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://github.com/psyray/oasis"
            }
          ]
        }
